WEBVTT

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:30.950
In another chapter,

00:04:30.950 --> 00:04:36.200
Ishmael sings the process 
of decanting whale oil in epic style,

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:40.145
as the ship pitches and rolls 
in the midnight sea

00:04:40.145 --> 00:04:44.377
and the casks rumble like landslides.

00:04:44.377 --> 00:04:48.800
A book so wide-ranging 
has something for everyone.

00:04:48.800 --> 00:04:52.611
Readers have found 
religious and political allegory,

00:04:52.611 --> 00:04:57.801
existential enquiry, 
social satire, economic analysis,

00:04:57.801 --> 00:05:00.851
and representations 
of American imperialism,